{
  "$schema": "../schemas/software.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "etcher",
  "name": "balenaEtcher",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/balena-io/etcher",
  "kind": "package",
  "packages": [
    {
      "platform": "windows",
      "architecture": "amd64",
      "channel": "stable",
      "source": {
        "driver": "scoop",
        "options": {
          "bucket": "extras",
          "app": "etcher",
          "architecture": "64bit"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "platform": "macos",
      "architecture": "amd64",
      "channel": "stable",
      "source": {
        "driver": "github-release",
        "options": {
          "repository": "balena-io/etcher",
          "assetPattern": "balenaEtcher-{version}-x64.dmg",
          "tagPrefix": "v",
          "tagTemplate": "v{version}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "platform": "macos",
      "architecture": "arm64",
      "channel": "stable",
      "source": {
        "driver": "github-release",
        "options": {
          "repository": "balena-io/etcher",
          "assetPattern": "balenaEtcher-{version}-arm64.dmg",
          "tagPrefix": "v",
          "tagTemplate": "v{version}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "platform": "linux",
      "architecture": "amd64",
      "channel": "stable",
      "source": {
        "driver": "github-release",
        "options": {
          "repository": "balena-io/etcher",
          "assetPattern": "balena-etcher_{version}_amd64.deb",
          "tagPrefix": "v",
          "tagTemplate": "v{version}"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "summary": "把系统镜像写入 USB 设备或存储卡，并校验结果。",
  "icon": {
    "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/balena-io/etcher/bfcfafd32e3628fccf924c8d17fcdb56e4ade989/assets/iconset/512x512.png",
    "sha256": "51b1bdad07a22707c64ff6ec2f4c8dedb7d962327e895a427e158cbccd3f9248",
    "mime": "image/png",
    "sourceKind": "official",
    "provenance": "固定官方产品资源，逐图预览确认身份及完整性；已核对所在目录和资源元数据，无独立美术授权声明时不冒称美术许可等同代码许可。仅用于介绍本产品，保留原图、比例、颜色与归属，不暗示官方背书。 原资源：https://github.com/balena-io/etcher/blob/bfcfafd32e3628fccf924c8d17fcdb56e4ade989/assets/iconset/512x512.png"
  },
  "description": "balenaEtcher 是独立的启动介质制作工具，提供选择镜像、选择目标设备和写入校验流程，适合准备自己的系统安装介质。\n\n### 源码与许可\n当前条目提供 2.1.7 官方原包。主项目许可：Apache-2.0；独立组件遵循各自许可。[固定版本源码](https://github.com/balena-io/etcher/tree/bfcfafd32e3628fccf924c8d17fcdb56e4ade989) · [许可原文](https://github.com/balena-io/etcher/blob/bfcfafd32e3628fccf924c8d17fcdb56e4ade989/LICENSE)。",
  "usageInstructions": "1. 下载对应平台官方原包，Windows 安装或解压，Mac 将应用放入自己的应用目录，Linux 按 DEB/AppImage 方式处理。\n2. 准备可信系统镜像与可清空的 USB/存储卡，选中镜像后逐项核对目标设备；确认原资料已备份再执行写入，等待校验完成后按系统方式弹出设备。\n3. 按固定版本官方说明核对依赖、配置与数据导出方式。",
  "faq": "会保留目标盘已有数据吗？写入镜像会覆盖目标设备，操作前核对设备并备份。\n会自动下载所有系统吗？系统镜像需自己取得。",
  "documentationUrl": "https://github.com/balena-io/etcher/blob/bfcfafd32e3628fccf924c8d17fcdb56e4ade989/README.md",
  "category": "system",
  "screenshots": []
}
